{"articleNo":"804","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=804&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009-1학기 대학원 학자금대출 신청 안내(신입생.재학생)▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.01.15","hit":"28499","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"492\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"31\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">2009-1학기 대학원 학자금 대출 신청 안내 (신입생 · 재학생)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">■ <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">학자금대출 신청시기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">1. 신청기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009.1.19(월) ~ 3. 30(월)</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">(토,일,공휴일 제외) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">2. 신청시간 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">: 09:00~24:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">3. 대출기간</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#ff1493\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009.1.19(월) ~ 3. 31(화)</font></span></font> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">4. 신청사이트 : </span><a href=\"http://www.studentloan.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">www.studentloan.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">(정부보증학자금대출 포털사이트)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">5. 대출범위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">매학기 등록금전액 + 생활비(100만원 한도) + 보증보험료</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">6. 대출자격</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> : 1953.1.1일 이후 출생자로서, 신용관리정보가 없고 현재 연체중이 아닌 자 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">7. 대출실행기간(약정체결)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ○ 신입생 추가 등록기간 : 2009. 1. 20(화) ~ 1. 21(수)&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff1493\">농협에서만 대출가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#1e90ff\">(기금승인자는&nbsp;본 대학원에서 부여한 </font><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">추가등록기간에 농협에서</font></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;대출실행하시기 바랍니다.)</font></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span>○ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">재학생 등록기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><strong>2009. 2. 17(화) ~ 2. 20(금)</strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">8. 대출이율 : 7.3%</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">※ 참고사항</span><span style=\"COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#8b008b\">대학원생은 일반대출로만 가능하며 무이자 및 저리대출 대상이 해당안됨</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">■ <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">학자금대출 신청절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">1. 공인인증서 발급 : 본교 수납은행(농협,대구은행,신한은행)에서 공인인증서를 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 발급한다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">※ 2009-1학기부터 우리대학 등록금 수납계약체결 은행이 국민은행에서 신한은행으로 변경되었음. 국민은행을 통해 약정체결을 했던 기이용자는 농협,대구은행,신한은행 중에서 한곳을 선택하여 약정체결을 해야함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">2. 학자금대출 신청 : 학자금포털에서 신청 및 보증심사</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">3. 기금승인결과 확인 : 학자금포털에서 기금승인여부 확인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">4. 대출약정체결 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(1) 은행방문시 구비서류 : 등록금고지서, 신분증, 도장 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">(2) 인터넷으로도 약정체결 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">(단 신입생은 제외)</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(3) 해당 은행과 학자금 대출 보증 및 약정을 체결하는 것임. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">5. 학자금 대출을 신청한 은행에서 우리대학교의 등록금 수납계좌로 등록금을 납부함. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#1e90ff\">&nbsp; </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">(신입생 중 등록금을 먼저 납부한 자는 학생의 통장으로 입금됨)</font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">6. 위 1~5번까지의 절차를 거쳐야 대출신청이 완료됨. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">■ 학자금 대출 신청 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 2009-1학기 신입생은 등록금을 먼저 납부한 후에도 학자금 대출 신청이 가능하나, </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;대학원의 재학생(복학생 포함)은 등록금 납부 후 대출은 불가능함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2.</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> </span><font color=\"#8b008b\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#8b008b\">신입생 학자금 대출 방법</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신입생 등록기간(2009.1.5 ~ 1.8)등록금을 먼저 자비로 납부한 학생이 대출을 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청하여&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">지정은행(농협)과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> 대출약정 체결하면 본인 계좌로 입금됨</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"돋움\">나</font>. <font face=\"돋움\">신입생 추가등록기간(2009.1.20 ~ 1.21)에 지정은행(농협)과 대출 약정체결하면</font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><font face=\"돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 우리대학교의 등록금 수납계좌로 등록금이 납부됨&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font>&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">■ 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">없음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">■ 문의전화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"> : 대학원지원팀(054-478-7015) 또는 학자금콜센터(1688-8114)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\">2009.&nbsp; 1.&nbsp; 15</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’돋움’\"><font size=\"3\">금오공과대학교 대학원(산업 및 교육대학원)장</font> </span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
